WEBVTT

36:44.167 --> 36:45.084
I said, speak out!

36:45.167 --> 36:46.042
Who the hell sent you, damn it?

36:46.125 --> 36:48.875
-I really don't know anything.
-Who sent you, man?

36:48.959 --> 36:50.459
-Do you want to tell us or die?
-Believe me, bro.

36:50.542 --> 36:52.250
-You bloody bugger! Tell us!
-Hey, stop!
